  "notes": [
    "Bachelor of Science in Chemistry, College of Sciences, Department of Chemistry. Adoption date Fall 2019-2020; Sharjah Main Campus; duration 4-6 years (min.-max.); language English; intake Fall, Spring & Summer; full-time. 'Total years = 4 / Total semesters = 8 / Total weeks = 128; Total number of courses = 48 / Total hours = 123'.",
    "Six-digit codes printed in the plan table without the leading zero were normalised to seven digits: 201102 -> 0201102 (Arabic Language or Arabic Language for non-Arabic Speakers), 202112 -> 0202112, 204102 -> 0204102, 202207 -> 0202207, 104101 -> 0104101 (Islamic Culture; other plans print Islamic Culture as 0104100, so this code needs a human check).",
    "Prerequisites come from the Course Description pages (credit pattern lecture-lab-credit, e.g. 3-0-3); courses without a description (university/support courses and electives) have null prerequisites. 'Pre/Co' = prerequisite or co-requisite. The description of General Chemistry II Lab prints its code as 10420104 (typo for 1420104).",
    "The plan table does not label courses compulsory/elective; only 'University Elective', 'Specialized Elective' (14204xx) and 'General Free Elective' (xxxxxxx) slots are typed elective, other types are null.",
    "Rows with year null are courses that have a description page but do not appear in the plan table (14204xx specialized-elective candidates, 3 credits each); they are not explicitly labelled elective in the PDF, so their type is null."
